cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "r-package-ci-template: CI, Release and Citation Setup for R Packages"
abstract: >-
  A GitHub template that sets up R CMD check, test coverage, a pkgdown site,
  release-please releases and citation files for R packages, either as a new
  repository or applied to an existing package.
